															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/godlyuser" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6876114); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6876114&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607513353" alt="GodlyUser" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6876114)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/godlyuser" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6876114); return false;" >GodlyUser</a></span> <span class="odate time_1606798630 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">01 Dec 2020 04:57</span>
														</div>
